data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"3003\">\n<td class=\"max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2\/3)]\" data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2937\"><strong data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2936\">Dry or Dehydrated<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2\/3)] min-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)\/3)]\" data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"3003\">Adds hydration without stickiness or heaviness.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3094\">\n<td class=\"max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2\/3)]\" data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3028\"><strong data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3027\">Hyperpigmentation<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2\/3)] min-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)\/3)]\" data-start=\"3028\" data-end=\"3094\">Licorice fades dark spots and acne scars over time.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3185\">\n<td class=\"max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2\/3)]\" data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3119\"><strong data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3110\">Dull Skin<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2\/3)] min-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)\/3)]\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3185\">Instantly brightens complexion and boosts skin clarity.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"3187\" data-end=\"3269\">Basically, if you\u2019ve got a face and you love glowing skin \u2014 this toner is for you.<\/p>\n<hr class=\"\" data-start=\"3271\" data-end=\"3274\" \/>\n<h2 class=\"\" data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3292\">\ud83e\uddf4 How to Use<\/h2>\n<ol data-start=\"3294\" data-end=\"3580\">\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"3294\" data-end=\"3367\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3367\"><strong data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3316\">After cleansing<\/strong>, pour a few drops into a cotton pad or your palms.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"3368\" data-end=\"3435\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3435\"><strong data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3394\">Gently swipe or pat<\/strong> across the face, avoiding eyes and lips.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"3436\" data-end=\"3533\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3533\"><strong data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3485\">Follow with serum, essence, or moisturizer<\/strong> while skin is still damp for better absorption.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"3534\" data-end=\"3580\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3580\">Use <strong data-start=\"3541\" data-end=\"3562\">morning and night<\/strong> for best results.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"3582\" data-end=\"3703\">Pro tip: Soak cotton pads with the toner and use as a quick 3-minute sheet mask on problem areas like cheeks or forehead.<\/p>","description":"<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<div class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"group\/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\n<div class=\"flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"2a1ad9c6-e2f2-4835-b9fa-ade8c2116b34\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\">\n<h3>ACWELL Licorice pH Balancing Cleansing Toner: The Ultimate Skincare Essential<\/h3>\n<p>The <strong>ACWELL Licorice pH Balancing Cleansing Toner<\/strong> is a must-have for anyone serious about maintaining healthy, glowing skin. Known for its soothing and brightening properties, this toner is more than just a refreshing splash in your routine. It&#8217;s a powerhouse product that works to balance the skin\u2019s pH, brighten the complexion, and keep skin irritation at bay, making it perfect for all skin types. Whether you&#8217;re dealing with dullness, redness, or sensitive skin, ACWELL&#8217;s Licorice Toner could be the solution your skincare routine has been missing.<\/p>\n<h4>Why ACWELL Licorice pH Balancing Cleansing Toner?<\/h4>\n<p>Balancing your skin&#8217;s pH is essential for maintaining its natural protective barrier, also known as the acid mantle. The ACWELL Licorice pH Balancing Cleansing Toner is specially formulated with a low pH of 5.5, which mirrors the skin&#8217;s natural pH, helping to protect it from environmental stressors, inflammation, and breakouts. Unlike toners that leave your skin feeling tight and dry, this product ensures optimal hydration while maintaining balance, creating the perfect base for the rest of your skincare regimen.<\/p>\n<h4>Key Ingredients<\/h4>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Licorice Root Extract<\/strong><br \/>\nThis toner\u2019s star ingredient is <strong>licorice root extract<\/strong>, a powerful antioxidant and skin-soothing agent known for its anti-inflammatory properties. Licorice helps brighten dark spots and hyperpigmentation by inhibiting melanin production, resulting in a clearer, more even skin tone. Additionally, it works to reduce redness and irritation, making it perfect for sensitive skin.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Peony Root Extract<\/strong><br \/>\nPeony root extract acts as an anti-inflammatory, reducing redness and irritation, while also working to brighten the complexion. It complements licorice extract, making the toner gentle yet effective.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Green Tea Extract<\/strong><br \/>\nGreen tea is packed with antioxidants that protect the skin from free radical damage. It also soothes and calms the skin, making it ideal for people prone to irritation or sensitivity. Green tea helps combat acne by regulating oil production and reducing inflammation.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Centella Asiatica<\/strong><br \/>\nKnown for its healing properties, <strong>Centella Asiatica<\/strong> helps soothe irritation, reduce redness, and repair the skin&#8217;s moisture barrier. It promotes skin regeneration, making it an excellent ingredient for healing blemishes and maintaining skin health.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h4>Benefits of ACWELL Licorice pH Balancing Cleansing Toner<\/h4>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Brightens and Evens Out Skin Tone<\/strong><br \/>\nThe licorice root extract in this toner works to lighten dark spots and reduce hyperpigmentation over time, giving your skin a more radiant and uniform appearance.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Soothes and Calms the Skin<\/strong><br \/>\nPeony root and green tea extracts work together to calm inflammation and redness, making this toner perfect for sensitive skin.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Restores pH Balance<\/strong><br \/>\nWith a pH of 5.5, this toner is ideal for restoring the skin\u2019s natural pH, which can be disrupted by cleansers and other skincare products. Maintaining this balance is essential for healthy, hydrated skin that\u2019s protected from irritation and breakouts.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Prepares the Skin for the Next Step<\/strong><br \/>\nOne of the most important functions of a toner is to prepare the skin for better absorption of serums, moisturizers, and treatments. ACWELL Licorice pH Balancing Cleansing Toner hydrates the skin and creates the perfect canvas for layering additional skincare products.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h4>How to Use<\/h4>\n<p>For best results, use the <strong>ACWELL Licorice pH Balancing Cleansing Toner<\/strong> as part of both your morning and evening routines. After cleansing, pour a small amount of the toner onto a cotton pad or your hands, and gently pat it into your face and neck. Follow up with a serum or moisturizer of your choice.<\/p>\n<h5>What Can It Be Mixed With?<\/h5>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Hyaluronic Acid<\/strong>: Works well with this toner, boosting hydration and making it a great combination for those with dry or sensitive skin.<\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress-538548-5635675.cloudwaysapps.com\/product-category\/niacinamide\/\"><strong>Niacinamide<\/strong><\/a>: Both ingredients help to brighten the skin, reduce redness, and improve skin texture, so they can work together beautifully.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h5>What Not to Mix With<\/h5>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Strong Acids<\/strong>: It\u2019s best to avoid pairing this toner with high concentrations of <strong>AHAs<\/strong> or <strong>BHAs<\/strong> in the same routine, as it may cause irritation, especially for sensitive skin.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Retinoids<\/strong>: Using retinol right after this toner may cause excessive dryness or irritation.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>Why You Need ACWELL Licorice pH Balancing Cleansing Toner<\/h4>\n<p>If you struggle with redness, hyperpigmentation, or dullness, or if you just want a more balanced skincare routine, <strong>ACWELL Licorice pH Balancing Cleansing Toner<\/strong> is the answer. Its combination of soothing and brightening ingredients will leave your skin looking radiant and feeling calm, all while restoring your skin\u2019s natural balance. Whether you&#8217;re starting your day or winding down, this toner is a crucial step in achieving and maintaining healthy, glowing skin.<\/p>\n<p>Grab your bottle today and experience the wonders of licorice root and other nourishing ingredients!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1115000","regular_price":"1115000","sale_price":"1115000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"NGN","currency_symbol":"\u20a6","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"\u20a6","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<sp